<BaseLayout title="Pronovo — Accessible language learning" description="Pronovo is a language-learning platform focused on accessible learning, consistent practice and progression." structuredData={breadcrumb}><PageHero eyebrow="Forfactor product · Language learning" title="Language learning, made easier to keep doing." intro="Pronovo is a language-learning platform focused on accessible learning and the steady practice that supports progress." crumbs={[["Home","/"],["Products","/products/"],["Pronovo","/products/pronovo/"]]}/>
<section class="section"><div class="shell prose-grid"><p class="eyebrow">What it is</p><div class="prose"><h2>Progress through consistent practice.</h2><p>Pronovo helps make language learning more accessible. Its focus is on creating a clear path for practice and progression, so learners can keep building their skills over time.</p><p><a class="button" href="https://pronovo.org">Visit Pronovo's official website ↗</a></p></div></div></section>
<section class="section alt"><div class="shell"><div class="principles"><div class="principle"><span class="eyebrow">01</span><h3>Accessible learning</h3><p>A straightforward way into language practice.</p></div><div class="principle"><span class="eyebrow">02</span><h3>Consistent practice</h3><p>Learning shaped around returning and continuing.</p></div><div class="principle"><span class="eyebrow">03</span><h3>Visible progression</h3><p>A focus on moving forward over time.</p></div></div></div></section></BaseLayout>
